silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_05_cannon_or_gpt_absorption_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'CannonOrGptAbsorptionConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, SousObservationRole_VetRecord: the sous position observing VetRecord_77's incoming profile (which typed legs enter MittensColimitApex from VetRecord_77) and outgoing profile (which universal mediators leave MittensColimitApex toward VetCarePlan_77 and GroomingLog_42) at the Tartu Animal Clinic; also, ITISTaxonomyEntry_TSN183798: the ITIS database row for Felis catus TSN 183798 in cannon/tax/ITIS.sqlite; the raw cannon witness that contributes the taxonomy vocabulary to the local olog after gate passage; also, TartuClinicIntakeForm: the raw source packet for Mittens's May 2026 annual exam; before gate passage it is a raw witness; after the four gates it becomes VetCarePlanPDF_77." .
